\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Wariness of  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  cushions euro. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Carolyn Cohn \par \uc2 592 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 September 2000\par 14:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, Sept 13 (Reuters) - The euro ran up gains against the dollar and the yen on Wednesday, recovering from the previous day's record lows after a German magazine article fuelled wariness of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Focus Money, in the summary of an article released in advance of publication, cited French government circles as saying the French presidency of the European Union had begun talks with the \b \highlight22\uc2 United States\b0 \highlight\uc2  to get backing for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  A French finance ministry spokeswoman later denied the report. \par \par \uc2  But wariness of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  fuelled by the report drove the euro above 93 yen for the first time in a week and to $0.87 , 1-1/2 cents above the previous day's record troughs. Rates subsided by more than half a cent and half a yen by 1130 GMT, to levels close to the previous day's close. \par \par \uc2  "Fear of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is the on-going theme that is holding the euro up," said Glenn Davies, chief economist at Credit Lyonnais in London. \par \par \uc2  "There is nothing in the economic fundamentals to change the downtrend, and all the comments coming from officials are adding confusion and panic, which is damaging for sentiment." \par \par \uc2  The incentive to keep pushing the euro higher was also seen reduced on Wednesday after Bundesbank council member Klaus-Dieter Kuehbacher said that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the euro would make sense only if the U.S. helped. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market was focusing next on the news conference following the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's fortnightly meeting on Thursday, with ECB President Wim Duisenberg so far reticent on the likelihood of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "So far, I see no indication that the ECB itself wants to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , given all the comments come from politicians," Elisabeth Legge senior economist at Bankgesellschaft Berlin, told Reuters Television. \par \par \uc2  Markets were also eyeing a Group of Seven finance ministers' meeting in Prague next week amid increasing nervousness that European authorities could discuss joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  with other G7 nations. \par \par \uc2  DANISH \b \highlight22\uc2 CENTRAL BANK INTERVENES\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  The Danish crown, meanwhile, recovered from testing record lows around 7.4670 against the euro after traders in Copenhagen spotted the Danish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokeswoman declined to comment. \par \par \uc2  Analysts and dealers attributed the crown's earlier decline to fresh opinion polls suggesting that Danes opposed to euro membership were pulling ahead of supporters, two weeks before Denmark's September 28 referendum on whether to join the euro. \par \par \uc2  The dollar traded in tiny ranges in comparison with the euro/dollar and euro/yen exchange rates. But it held a firm tone, making a sustained break of 107 for the first time since August 25. \par \par \uc2  "People are buying dollars against Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in general," said a trader from a Japanese bank in London. \par \par \uc2  "It's a trend we have seen for the past two or three days." \par \par \uc2  Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  lost ground across the board on Wednesday, led by losses in the Indonesian rupiah. A powerful explosion rocked the Jakarta stock exchange, killing at least one person, one day before the resumption of disgraced former President Suharto's corruption trial. \par \par \uc2  Joining the list of victims of a raging dollar was the Australian dollar , which fell in Sydney trade to record lows against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  around US$0.5525. \par \par \uc2  The Australian dollar was undermined by disappointment over a 0.7 percent increase in second quarter gross doemstic product and a sharp 8.1 percent fall in consumer confidence, analysts said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw9d0803e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
