\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Euro plunges to record lows, whips back up. \b0\par\par\uc2      By Shinichi Kishima \par \uc2 624 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Februar 2000\par 10:27\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      LONDON, Feb 28 (Reuters) - The euro ripped into record low \par \par \uc2  territory against the dollar on Monday as its failure to sustain \par \par \uc2  a recovery rally last week disenchanted investors, but it then \par \par \uc2  whipsawed back upamid wariness of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      A gap in economic growth between the \b \highlight22\uc2 United States\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \par \par \uc2  Europe, waning prospects of an imminent European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  interest rate increase and persistent concerns over structural \par \par \uc2  rigidities in European economies all led many investors to dump \par \par \uc2  the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , market analysts said. \par \par \uc2      The growth gap had been highlighted last Friday when gross \par \par \uc2  domestic product data showed the U.S. economy expanded at a \par \par \uc2  blistering annual pace of 6.9 percent in the fourth quarter. \par \par \uc2      At one point in a chaotic Asian session on Monday, the euro \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par plunged 3.6 percent to a record trough around $0.94\tab    ,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dropping far below its previous lifetime low around $0.9660 -- a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par level to which it quickly bounced back up.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "Once we fell below $0.9665, the old low, there was an\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par enormous amount of stop-loss orders and there was very poor\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par liquidity," said Cameron Crise, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist at\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Warburg Dillon Read in London.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Analysts said the issue now was whether the ECB could instil\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par some stability into the market through \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  or monetary\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par tightening and whether the euro's mounting losses induced more\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par stop-loss selling.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Finnish Finance Minister Sauli Niinisto said his\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par counterparts from the 11-nation euro member countries were to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par meet on Monday to discuss the euro's slide.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "With the euro at these levels they will be very unhappy,"\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par said Neil Parker, treasury economist at Royal Bank of Scotland.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "If it slides to $0.90, the ECB would have to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  because\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par it would be a snowballing effect."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     In early European trading, traders said bargain hunting was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par pushing the euro back up. It was up more than two percent from\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the early record lows.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "As of now, people seem to be happy to buy this dip, but you\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par have to reckon that if we don't break back above the $0.9650/65\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par level, the risk is that we see more selling," Crise at Warburg\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par said. "The issue now is what are the Europeans going to do about\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par it. Just to say it's got the potential to appreciate would not\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par be enough -- they've been saying that since we were at $1.10."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     YEN STRENGTH BACK IN FOCUS\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Tokyo traders noted that among a torrent of loss-cutting\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par euro selling, a large number of Japanese institutional investors\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par were selling euros for yen to hedge their exposures in European\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par asset markets.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The yen rose to four-week highs against the euro\tab \par near 104 yen and also gained sharply against the dollar\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to two-week highs around 108.40 yen in a market driven by\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par stop-loss orders.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "There was no fundamental event, no piece of news behind\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par it," said Ken Landon, senior \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist at Deutsche\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Bank in Tokyo. "Rather, the price action itself is the story."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Some analysts noted that erratic price actions have not been\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par limited to the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market lately and that there was an\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par eerie feeling across the board in financial markets.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "My concern is that the markets are behaving very strangely\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par at the moment - the way the stock markets are, the way (yield)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par curves are inverted in the U.S. and so forth," said Claudio\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Piron, treasury economist at Standard Chartered Bank in London.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "It means that the whole system is very fragile, very\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par confused and there could be some near-term risk of some\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par significant disruption."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ((London Capital Markets +44-171-542-6721,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par shinichi.kishima@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 2000.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw2s06af3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
